# ReleaseCheck platform credentials
#
# Optional. Adapters degrade to `not_configured` (unknown snapshots) when
# these are absent — the local demo, evaluation, and golden gates all run
# without them.

# Spotify Web API (Client Credentials)
# Create an app at https://developer.spotify.com/dashboard → Client ID/Secret.
# NOTE (2026-08): Web API search returns 403 without a Spotify Premium
# subscription. Keys are harmless to store; ingest works once Premium exists.
SPOTIFY_CLIENT_ID=
SPOTIFY_CLIENT_SECRET=

# SoundCloud API (Client Credentials, OAuth 2.1)
# Requires Artist Pro subscription ($99/yr) + app registration per
# docs/soundcloud-policy.md (I9-2 decision). Endpoints re-verify on issue.
SOUNDCLOUD_CLIENT_ID=
SOUNDCLOUD_CLIENT_SECRET=

# Optional: prebuilt rc-worker binary (skips cargo run on each bridge call)
# RELEASE_CHECK_CORE_BIN=/path/to/rc-worker
